FILTRE-ARR 1
# An arrangement for FILTRE, made with the arranger: docs/arranger
# The device reads BPM, P and S lines. Everything else is the tool's.
NAME Example: filter house in 64 bars
BPM 124
P 1 2 main loop
P 2 1 break
S 1 4 1FE0
S 1 4 1FC0
S 1 8 0000
S 2 8 1FE1
S 1 8 0000
S 1 4 1FC0
TEMPO 124.000
DOWNBEAT 0.0000
M 1 8 1 1FE0
M 9 8 1 1FC0
M 17 16 1 0000
M 33 8 2 1FE1
M 41 16 1 0000
M 57 8 1 1FC0
